*% PPD for Ricoh SP 211 / SP 213 class GDI printers using the native
*% rastertosp211 CUPS filter (Apple Silicon, no Rosetta required).
*% Option keywords match those understood by the filter.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "SP211NAT.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "RICOH"
*Product: "(SP 211)"
*Product: "(RICOH SP 211)"
*ModelName: "RICOH SP 211"
*ShortNickName: "RICOH SP 211 native"
*NickName: "RICOH SP 211 (native Apple Silicon)"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:RICOH;MDL:SP 211;"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "23"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.1
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsManualCopies: False
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 /Library/Printers/SP211Native/Filters/rastertosp211"

*% Manual duplex is not available for these sizes (same rule as the filter)
*UIConstraints: *Duplex *PageSize B5
*UIConstraints: *PageSize B5 *Duplex
*UIConstraints: *Duplex *PageSize B6
*UIConstraints: *PageSize B6 *Duplex
*UIConstraints: *Duplex *PageSize A5L
*UIConstraints: *PageSize A5L *Duplex
*UIConstraints: *Duplex *PageSize A5
