*UIConstraints: *PageSize AuFOOLSCAP *Duplex
*UIConstraints: *Duplex *PageSize 16K3
*UIConstraints: *PageSize 16K3 *Duplex
*UIConstraints: *Duplex *PageSize HalfLetter
*UIConstraints: *PageSize HalfLetter *Duplex

