*HWMargins: 12 12 12 12
*CustomPageSize True: "pop pop pop <</PageSize[5 -2 roll]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*ParamCustomPageSize Width: 1 points 283.464569091797 612.283508300781
*ParamCustomPageSize Height: 2 points 419.527557373047 1009.133911132812
